profile.comment=Potato: Maximum FPS (160+ FPS, no raymarching) | Low: Fast 3D clouds | Medium: Ray-traced water reflections | High: SSGI & Godrays | Ultra: Maximum visual fidelity.
option.SSR=Screen-Space Ray-Traced Reflections
option.SSR.comment=Traces reflections against visible scene depth. Objects outside the screen use a sky fallback. Does not use RTX hardware or full-world path tracing.
option.SSR_STEPS=Reflection Ray Steps
option.SSGI=Screen-Space Indirect Light
option.SSGI.comment=Traces short hemisphere rays for visible-surface light bounce. Higher sample counts cost GPU time. Off-screen lights are not traced.
